     europass.md.j2 — Europass-model rendering for EU applications, public-sector
     competitions and universities that require the Europass layout.

     THE POINT OF THIS FILE: Europass invites personal data. Photo, date of birth,
     nationality, gender and address are fields the form offers, and an applicant
     who fills them hands over protected characteristics that no reviewer needs to
     assess the application. They are emitted here as EMPTY LABELS — present, so
     nobody thinks the form was answered wrongly, and blank, so nothing is
     disclosed. The kill-list gate enforces that: a label followed by a value is
     an ERROR and the file is not written.
---------------------------------------------------------------------------- -#}
